{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ribbit Up: Frog Climber</strong> is a climbing game you can play solo or with up to 10 players. Take revenge on the witch who pushed you down by climbing back to the princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/firstgif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has one rule: JUMP! See a rock? Jump on it. Spot a tent? Jump on it. If you can reach it, you can climb it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/jumpgif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t fear falling\u2014you\u2019ll always respawn at the campfire to warm up and try again. Leap, explore, and out-hop rivals in this chaotic vertical climb!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/campfiregif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667740?t=1745066987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667740?t=1745066987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/19b953fbc194ae6a6d2399d59963a9eb9c430297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745066987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/19b953fbc194ae6a6d2399d59963a9eb9c430297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745066987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ribbit Up: Frog Climber</strong> is a climbing game you can play solo or with up to 10 players. Take revenge on the witch who pushed you down by climbing back to the princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/firstgif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has one rule: JUMP! See a rock? Jump on it. Spot a tent? Jump on it. If you can reach it, you can climb it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/jumpgif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t fear falling\u2014you\u2019ll always respawn at the campfire to warm up and try again. Leap, explore, and out-hop rivals in this chaotic vertical climb!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/extras/campfiregif.gif?t=1745066987\" /></p>","developers":["Team K6"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667740/a4007676af368b0c48eb82404b4b4da7a937da94/header.jpg?t=1745066987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Ribbit Up: Frog Climber","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5200U or higher/equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRam or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Proces